[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9662.15, "timestamp": "02:41:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9666.93, "timestamp": "02:41:06", "text": "不过我不会在这里待太久。这一切都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9669.19, "timestamp": "02:41:09", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9672.55, "timestamp": "02:41:12", "text": "或许是出于紧急情况而制作的。 H"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9676.63, "timestamp": "02:41:16", "text": "那也很好。问题是，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9680.23, "timestamp": "02:41:20", "text": "我做完了吗？我很久以前就做了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9684.87, "timestamp": "02:41:24", "text": "很久以前就做过类似的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9690.469, "timestamp": "02:41:30", "text": "所以我就想，我还能保留这个吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9694.469, "timestamp": "02:41:34", "text": "你知道，那个老家伙仍然可以保留"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9697.99, "timestamp": "02:41:37", "text": "故事和结尾也是这样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9701.33, "timestamp": "02:41:41", "text": "所以我就想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9703.59, "timestamp": "02:41:43", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9706.95, "timestamp": "02:41:46", "text": "真是太飒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9709.75, "timestamp": "02:41:49", "text": "还有，就像昨天一样，我的天哪，怎么会这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9712.79, "timestamp": "02:41:52", "text": "多次出现过明显的崩溃吗？"}]